%% 08 Incident lifecycle
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> open: first alert on host
  open --> correlated: more alerts within gap
  correlated --> correlated: more alerts
  open --> explained: summary produced
  correlated --> explained: summary produced
  explained --> notified: budget + mode + routing allow
  explained --> acknowledged: admin ack in GUI/CLI
  notified --> acknowledged
  acknowledged --> resolved: admin resolves
  acknowledged --> dismissed: admin dismisses as false positive
  explained --> dismissed
  notified --> dismissed
  resolved --> [*]
  dismissed --> [*]
